WEBVTT

1
00:00:18.825 --> 00:00:21.207
watched the other second graders run outside.

2
00:00:23.528 --> 00:00:24.929
Their parents were picking them up.

3
00:00:26.871 --> 00:00:28.312
But Nina's mom worked late.

4
00:00:31.244 --> 00:00:33.065
So Nina was going to Kids Central.

5
00:00:35.365 --> 00:00:36.686
Nina walked into the gym.

6
00:00:39.326 --> 00:00:41.727
She wished she could go home and play in her backyard.

7
00:00:43.387 --> 00:00:48.309
A big banner over the windows read "After-School Fun Games Kids Central!"

8
00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.550
Nina didn't see anyone she knew.

9
00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:54.891
She felt nervous.

10
00:00:54.911 --> 00:00:59.552
"Oh, there's my name."

11
00:01:02.088 --> 00:01:05.070
Nina spotted a name tag with her name on it and sat down.

12
00:01:11.355 --> 00:01:13.436
Izzie was excited to be at Kids Central.

13
00:01:15.958 --> 00:01:17.439
But her name tag was wrong.

14
00:01:17.459 --> 00:01:20.962
"Isabel?" Izzie read.

15
00:01:20.982 --> 00:01:23.204
"I'm Izzie, not Isabel!"

16
00:01:24.645 --> 00:01:26.266
Izzie looked at the boy next to her.

17
00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:28.988
"You must be Jason."

18
00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:33.573
"Welcome, everyone!

19
00:01:33.913 --> 00:01:36.555
Please find your seat," Miss Shelly called.

20
00:01:37.736 --> 00:01:39.678
Miss Shelly was the Kids Central teacher.

21
00:01:40.818 --> 00:01:42.500
Nina thought she had a nice smile.

22
00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:48.564
"Today we're going to decorate name tags," Miss Shelly said.

23
00:01:50.686 --> 00:01:52.767
A tall boy sat down next to Nina.

24
00:01:53.808 --> 00:01:54.889
He didn't say hello.

25
00:01:56.951 --> 00:01:58.672
But his name tag said "BOBBY."

26
00:02:00.136 --> 00:02:02.397
"Look through the magazines on your table.

27
00:02:04.198 --> 00:02:07.519
Cut out pictures of things you like," Miss Shelly said.

28
00:02:07.539 --> 00:02:12.241
"For example, Nina, what do you like?"

29
00:02:12.621 --> 00:02:13.622
Miss Shelly asked.

30
00:02:14.842 --> 00:02:15.742
Nina smiled.

31
00:02:15.762 --> 00:02:22.105
"I like the color purple and I like my rain boots," she answered shyly.

32
00:02:22.125 --> 00:02:26.627
"Nice! Jason, what do you like?"

33
00:02:28.287 --> 00:02:29.248
Miss Shelly waited.

34
00:02:30.204 --> 00:02:34.246
"Jason?" Izzie poked Jason's arm.

35
00:02:34.266 --> 00:02:37.588
"He likes video games," she said.

36
00:02:37.608 --> 00:02:42.871
"Jason, we don't play video games at Kids Central.

37
00:02:43.752 --> 00:02:44.832
Please put that away."

38
00:02:45.232 --> 00:02:46.813
Miss Shelly sounded serious.

39
00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:51.176
"Besides video games, what do you like?"

40
00:02:53.177 --> 00:02:54.157
Jason looked up.

41
00:02:54.177 --> 00:02:57.579
"Cheeseburgers." "Great!

42
00:02:58.059 --> 00:02:58.780
Start cutting!"

43
00:02:59.188 --> 00:03:01.049
Miss Shelly pointed to the magazines.

44
00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:05.933
"Please pass me that magazine," Nina said.

45
00:03:10.436 --> 00:03:12.858
pass me those scissors," Bobby said.

46
00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:16.961
Izzie waved her hand in the air.

47
00:03:16.981 --> 00:03:19.103
"Miss Shelly?

48
00:03:19.563 --> 00:03:20.844
I need a new name tag.

49
00:03:21.945 --> 00:03:23.766
Only my grandma calls me Isabel.

50
00:03:25.007 --> 00:03:28.296
Everyone calls me Izzie."

51
00:03:28.316 --> 00:03:29.117
"I'm sorry!

52
00:03:29.617 --> 00:03:31.239
You can make a new name tag."

53
00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:34.422
Miss Shelly handed her some stiff paper.

54
00:03:34.442 --> 00:03:37.845
"Punch two holes in the top."

55
00:03:38.245 --> 00:03:39.066
Izzie punched.

56
00:03:43.489 --> 00:03:46.272
write your name in big, beautiful letters.

57
00:03:50.255 --> 00:03:52.918
Now take all the pictures you cut out.

58
00:03:53.718 --> 00:03:55.440
Glue them onto your name tag.

59
00:03:56.372 --> 00:04:00.375
You can glue them on the front, on the back, or on both sides!

60
00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:11.383
When you're done, choose a piece of yarn.

61
00:04:12.524 --> 00:04:14.445
Thread it through the holes on your tag.

62
00:04:17.007 --> 00:04:20.229
Ta-da! Your name tag becomes a necklace!"

63
00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:23.932
Miss Shelly tied her name tag around her neck.

64
00:04:27.124 --> 00:04:30.006
"You could also hang it on your bedroom doorknob."

65
00:04:42.593 --> 00:04:47.155
"Nina, your mom's here," Miss Shelly called.

66
00:04:48.356 --> 00:04:49.596
Nina looked surprised.

67
00:04:49.616 --> 00:04:52.738
"Is Kids Central over already?"

68
00:04:52.758 --> 00:04:57.190
"Yep. Time to go home, sweetie," her mom said.

69
00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:59.473
"Bye, Miss Shelly!"

70
00:05:00.013 --> 00:05:01.315
Nina ran to her mom.

71
00:05:01.335 --> 00:05:04.059
"Look what I made!"
